---@alias gcp.unstable.file_v1beta1.NfsExportOptionsSecurityFlavorsItemEnum "SECURITY_FLAVOR_UNSPECIFIED"|"AUTH_SYS"|"KRB5"|"KRB5I"|"KRB5P"

---@alias gcp.unstable.file_v1beta1.NfsExportOptionsSecurityFlavorsItemEnumList (gcp.unstable.file_v1beta1.NfsExportOptionsSecurityFlavorsItemEnum|string)[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.file_v1beta1.NfsExportOptionsSquashModeEnum "SQUASH_MODE_UNSPECIFIED"|"NO_ROOT_SQUASH"|"ROOT_SQUASH"

---This resource represents a long-running operation that is the result of a network API call.
